{
  "about": "Rank-based 1-10 success scores: (rate, requests) of the networks of one target, window and place, and the score each gets. tests/test_success_score_cases.py checks proxy-index's metric_scores (calculated/target_scores.py) and api/internal/build/success_score_test.go the API's place scores against the same cases (SUCCESS-SCORE-API-1).",
  "cases": [
